stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: prepare_upload<br/>writes UPLOAD_KV
    pending --> completed: PUT /upload succeeds<br/>sha256 match
    pending --> failed: drive error<br/>or sha256 mismatch
    pending --> [*]: TTL expires (no PUT)
    completed --> [*]: TTL (24h) expires
    failed --> [*]: TTL (1h) expires

    note right of pending
        TTL: token_ttl + 3600s
        userId / size / contentType / sha256?
    end note

    note right of completed
        actualSize, actualSha256
        driveFileId, driveName, driveMime
    end note

    note right of failed
        failureReason recorded
        Drive file deleted on sha256 mismatch
    end note
